        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 69054,
            "text": "Hi, glad we could find a slot this week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 89770,
            "end": 131202,
            "text": "Hi, glad this time worked for both of us."
          },
          {
            "start": 131203,
            "end": 200256,
            "text": "Hey, thanks for sticking with this time slot."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-05",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 207161,
            "end": 234783,
            "text": "We have a short list today, nothing too complicated."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 241688,
            "end": 296931,
            "text": "Let's get into it, what would you like to start with?"
          },
          {
            "start": 296932,
            "end": 345269,
            "text": "Let me know what is top of mind and we will work through it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-05",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 359079,
            "end": 407417,
            "text": "Every few weeks a batch of transactions shows up twice in the ledger after the sync runs, and finance has to hunt down which one to remove."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-05",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 428133,
            "end": 441944,
            "text": "Our July close had 9 duplicate entries come through, adding up to roughly 4,300 dollars our bookkeeper had to back out."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 462660,
            "end": 469565,
            "text": "Thanks for laying that out, I want to make sure I understand it fully."
          },
          {
            "start": 469566,
            "end": 490281,
            "text": "Can you tell me which close date that was and roughly how many entries were affected?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-05",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 510997,
            "end": 545524,
            "text": "It was the July 31st close, 9 entries, each one duplicated once."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 566240,
            "end": 593862,
            "text": "Good to have that squared away, what else is going on for you all?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-05",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 600767,
            "end": 628389,
            "text": "Our board likes to see a renewal update every month during this stretch."
          }
